

translate es strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:18
    old "A tale of two Emperors"
    new "Una historia de dos emperadores"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:19
    old "Emperor Alcott himself has ordered me and Markus to investigate suspicious Demorai activity in the Valley of Death."
    new "El emperador Alcott en persona nos ha ordenado a Markus y a mí investigar la sospechosa actividad demorai en el Valle de la muerte."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Meet Markus at the city gates"
    new "Reúnete con Markus a las puertas de la ciudad"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Markus should be waiting to join me outside the city gates."
    new "Markus debería estar esperando para reunirse conmigo fuera de las puertas de la ciudad."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Head out into the Valley of Death"
    new "Adéntrate en el Valle de la muerte"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "We have teamed up with Markus and set out for the Valley of Death. I wonder what we will find there..."
    new "Nos hemos juntado con Markus y hemos partido hacia el Valle de la Muerte. Me pregunto qué encontraremos allí..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Explore the suspicious ruins"
    new "Explora las ruinas sospechosas"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "A Demorai trail led us to what seems to be a ruined temple amidst the desert. We should tread carefully."
    new "Un rastro emorai nos llevó a lo que parece ser un templo en ruinas en medio del desierto. Debemos andar con cuidado."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Report your findings"
    new "Informa de tus resultados"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:20
    old "Apparently, the Demorai talk. Me and Markus have seen Some Demorai overlord beating the war drum real loud in an abandoned temple, east of the Valley of Death.\nWe should return to Novaras and report what we have seen."
    new "Al parecer, los demorai hablan. Markus y yo hemos visto algunos jefes demorai tocando el tambor de guerra muy fuerte en un templo abandonado, al este del Valle de la Muerte.\nDeberíamos volver a Novaras e informar de lo que hemos visto."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:58
    old "Ruins"
    new "Ruinas"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/qst_TwoEmperors.rpy:59
    old "Statue"
    new "Estatua"

